</fieldset></div><div class=\"vjs-track-settings-font\"><fieldset class=\"vjs-font-percent vjs-track-setting\"><legend id=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1907_component_2471\">Font Size</legend><select id=\"vjs_select_2548\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1907_component_2471\"><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2549-50\" value=\"0.50\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2549-50\">50%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2550-75\" value=\"0.75\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2550-75\">75%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2551-100\" value=\"1.00\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2551-100\">100%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2552-125\" value=\"1.25\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2552-125\">125%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2553-150\" value=\"1.50\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2553-150\">150%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2554-175\" value=\"1.75\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2554-175\">175%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2555-200\" value=\"2.00\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2555-200\">200%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2556-300\" value=\"3.00\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2556-300\">300%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2557-400\" value=\"4.00\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2557-400\">400%</option></select></fieldset><fieldset class=\"vjs-edge-style vjs-track-setting\"><legend id=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1907_component_2471\">Text Edge Style</legend><select id=\"vjs_select_2567\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1907_component_2471\"><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2568-None\" value=\"none\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2568-None\">None</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2569-Raised\" value=\"raised\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2569-Raised\">Raised</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2570-Depressed\" value=\"depressed\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2570-Depressed\">Depressed</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2571-Uniform\" value=\"uniform\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2571-Uniform\">Uniform</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2572-Dropshadow\" value=\"dropshadow\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2572-Dropshadow\">Drop shadow</option></select></fieldset><fieldset class=\"vjs-font-family vjs-track-setting\"><legend id=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1907_component_2471\">Font Family</legend><select id=\"vjs_select_2582\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1907_component_2471\"><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2583-ProportionalSansSerif\" value=\"proportionalSansSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2583-ProportionalSansSerif\">Proportional Sans-Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2584-MonospaceSansSerif\" value=\"monospaceSansSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2584-MonospaceSansSerif\">Monospace Sans-Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2585-ProportionalSerif\" value=\"proportionalSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2585-ProportionalSerif\">Proportional Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2586-MonospaceSerif\" value=\"monospaceSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2586-MonospaceSerif\">Monospace Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2587-Casual\" value=\"casual\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2587-Casual\">Casual</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2588-Script\" value=\"script\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2588-Script\">Script</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2589-SmallCaps\" value=\"small-caps\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1907_component_2471 vjs-track-option-2589-SmallCaps\">Small Caps</option></select></fieldset></div><div class=\"vjs-track-settings-controls\"><button class=\"vjs-default-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"restore all settings to the default values\" aria-disabled=\"false\">Reset</button><button class=\"vjs-done-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Done\" aria-disabled=\"false\">Done</button></div></div><button class=\"vjs-close-button vjs-control vjs-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Close Modal Dialog\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"vjs-icon-placeholder\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"vjs-control-text\" aria-live=\"polite\">Close Modal Dialog</span></button><p class=\"vjs-control-text\">End of dialog window.</p></div></video-js></div></div></div>\n<div>要想获得财富，就必须充分利用杠杆效应。商业杠杆来自资本、劳动力和复制边际成本为零的产品（代码和媒体）\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/b76ef5z8l2_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">我</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>昵称：7</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>经历</div>\n<div>后端程序员，觉得写前端很酷，去学了前端</div>\n<div>即刻刷到飞哥，觉得出海很酷，学习出海</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">我的独立开发入门之路</h1>\n<h4>1、大量建站探索</h4>\n<div>初期通过建立多个小型网站，广撒网寻找市场机会。这个阶段重在积累经验，了解网站运营的基本逻辑和用户需求模式。</div>\n<h4>2、有啥做啥-啥火做啥</h4>\n<div>尝试了新词汇、侵权词和品牌词的不同路径。特别注意：品牌词虽有流量，但风险高\n狠狠的做 → 狗都不做 → 做的就是品牌词 → 上一个 feature 页</div>\n<h4>3、遭遇挫折</h4>\n<div>谷歌排名打压 &amp; 支付封禁</div>\n<h4>4、精品工具站 &amp; 持续探索</h4>\n<div>从失败中总结经验，开始区别对待不同项目，将资源集中到少数几个有潜力的精品工具站</div>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">心得&amp;感受</h1>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/b76ef5z8l2_img2.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">软技能-阶段 1: 先做</h1>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/b76ef5z8l2_img3.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\"我有个很好的想法\"的雷区。</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>直接向成功案例学习</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>    google 排名靠前\n</span>    toolify\n    taaft\n    hackernews</code></div></pre>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>乔布斯：\"差艺术家模仿，好艺术家窃取\"—从别人那里吸取灵感，而不是简单地像素级致敬。</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>怎么抄：<strong>Bad artists copy，Good artists steal</strong>——差艺术家模仿，好艺术家窃取【从别人那里吸取灵感，而不是像素级致敬】</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">软技能-阶段 2：继续做 &amp; 向上看</h1>\n<h4>先模仿，再优化，最后差异化</h4>\n<div>找对标：Canva，AIEase【承受住谷歌的期待】</div>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">混合策略</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>新词&amp;老词</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>参考前人分享</div>\n<div><a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/mcaphl8h2o\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BingNi - 从追新词到做高KD词的心路历程</a>\n<a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/3u7g3k9co2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Baird - 从职场人到独立开发者的出海之旅</a>\n<a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/jpthqh1v9r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lucas杨 - 产品经理探索AI工具出海经验分享</a>\n<a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/82ea980d818446bfbee3daea735126ea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">阿彪-谈谈海量 SEO 页面以及最近的一些收获</a></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div>source\n1、ai 导航</div>\n<ul>\n<li>toolify</li>\n<li>taaft</li>\n</ul>\n<div>2、流量分析</div>\n<ul>\n<li>similarweb &amp; semrush</li>\n<li>aitdk</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">软技能小结</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>差艺术家模仿，好艺术家窃取</strong></li>\n<li><strong>先模仿，再优化，最后差异化/超越</strong></li>\n<li><strong>先完成，再完美</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>一无所有时，先做起来</h4>\n<div>初期可以尝试不同赛道：新词、老词甚至边缘词。这个阶段重点是跑通全流程，不要过分纠结于完美，内化社群分享的知识需要时间，先迈出第一步最重要。</div>\n<h4>获得反馈后，继续迭代</h4>\n<div>有了初步反馈，开始有针对性地改进产品。这时可以开始向更成熟的方向看齐，向上学习成功案例，提升自己的认知和产品水平。</div>\n<h4>建立用户反馈闭环</h4>\n<div>通过邮件、Featurebase、Discord等渠道及时获取用户反馈，这不仅是改进产品的关键，也是挖掘新需求的重要手段，帮助你发现用户真正的痛点。</div>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">一些观点</h1>\n<h4>速度是门槛，不是壁垒</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>单一工具 → 复杂工具</li>\n<li>SOP的重要性</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>以用户的视角去体验</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>粗制滥造 → 精品制作</li>\n<li>是否愿意留在自己开发的网站上?</li>\n<li>多看好的东西，就知道什么 好&amp;不好</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>尝试付费</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>优惠券挽留</li>\n<li>邮件再营销</li>\n<li>每日活动 &amp;  免费试用</li>\n<li>促活手段</li>\n<li>做好转化归因</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>策略</h4>\n<div>1、学习优等生的策略【E.g: Feature Canva/Pollo/AIEase】</div>\n<ul>\n<li>差艺术家模仿，好艺术家窃取</li>\n</ul>\n<div>2、多快好省</div>\n<ul>\n<li>多：功能多, ALL IN ONE, 一份钱可以体验多个功能</li>\n<li>快：网站速度快，等待时间短</li>\n<li>好：UI好，体验好</li>\n<li>省：性价比高</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">硬技能</h1>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/b76ef5z8l2_img4.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><a href=\"https://shipany.ai/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ship Any AI SaaS Startups in hours | ShipAny</a>\n<a href=\"https://shipfa.st/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Launch Your Startup in Days, Not Weeks | ShipFast</a></div>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">坑：品牌词</h1>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/b76ef5z8l2_img5.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">总结</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>在牌桌上，以身入局</strong></li>\n<li><strong>用户为本</strong></li>\n<li><strong>先模仿，再优化，最后差异化</strong></li>\n<li><strong>先完成，再完美</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<div>保持线性进步！</div>\n</blockquote>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/b76ef5z8l2_img6.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
